        // After a successful withdrawAll on the correct contract, address(c).balance must have decreased by exactly depositAmt
        // We only assert the property when the external call from c to helper returned/allowed a successful withdraw (ok == true)
        // This mirrors the intended single-withdraw semantics: one successful withdraw transfers depositAmt out.
        if (ok) {
